            <ArticleTitle>Sporadic malignant nerve sheath tumour of the oculomotor nerve.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>617-22; discussion 622</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Malignant peripheral nerve sheath tumours (MPNST) are exceedingly rare in an intracranial location. In this report clinical and pathological evidence for the diagnosis of a MPNST arising from of the oclumotor nerve is presented. To our knowledge this is the first such case reported in the medical literature.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
